<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-GERMAN LEAGUE CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a German League Cup</p>
<p>tournament match played on Friday;</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen 2 Karlsruhe 2 (halftime 2-1)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bayer Leverkusen - Beinlich 5, Kirsten 21</p>
<p>Karlsruhe - Reich 7, Dundee 81</p>
<p>Attendance: 6,000.</p>
<p>Karlsruhe won 6-5 on penalties.</p>
</text>
